	(text "At the moment, the +5V is powering:\n- Headphone Amp\n- DAC output op-amp\n- Reference voltage for CV inputs\n- 6002 buffer for AREF_AUDIO_BIAS\n\nWe can remove this, and simplify slightly if we:\n- Power Headphone Amp from +3v3_A\n- Change DAC output op-amp to a rail-to-rail opamp that supports higher voltage (i.e. OPA1652)\n- Power DAC output op-amp from +9V_A\n- Add LM4040 for +5V reference for CV inputs\n- Use TL074 or something for AREF_AUDIO_BIAS buffer instead, and power at +9V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.042 13.208 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6e7f02de-9555-4b15-a39e-4f8ace823df4")
	)
